OL,3,ANorth Korea expels Swiss diplomat in
OL,4,Asanctions row
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Korea has ordered Switzerland's
OL,7,Fdiplomatic representative to leave the
OL,8,Fcountry within 48 hours and called for
OL,9,Fthe office to close amid a row over
OL,10,Fsanctions.
OL,12,FIt said the move was in response to
OL,13,FSwitzerland's decision to place
OL,14,Fsanctions on the Songdowon
OL,15,Finternational children's camp. State
OL,16,Fmedia described this as "a blatant
OL,17,Fhostile act".
OL,19,FThat camp is at the centre of claims
OL,20,Fthat it was involved in transferring
OL,21,Fchildren from Russian-occupied areas of
OL,22,FUkraine.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
