OL,3,ANorth Korea expels Swiss diplomat in
OL,4,Asanctions row
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Korea's foreign ministry said
OL,7,F"any act of violating the sovereign
OL,8,Frights" of the country and the
OL,9,Finterests of its citizens "can never be
OL,10,Fwelcomed".
